<h1 id="%D0%9F%D1%80%D0%B8%D0%BC%D0%B5%D1%80-%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%B0%D0%BB%D0%B8%D0%B7%D0%B0%D1%86%D0%B8%D0%B8">Пример реализации<a class="anchor-link" href="#%D0%9F%D1%80%D0%B8%D0%BC%D0%B5%D1%80-%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%B0%D0%BB%D0%B8%D0%B7%D0%B0%D1%86%D0%B8%D0%B8">¶</a></h1>
</div>
</div>
